{
    "title": "Funny Weather: Rude Forecast",
    "description": "\u26a1\u2601\ufe0fWeather just got a whole lot funnier! \u2601\ufe0f\u26a1\r\n\r\nIs the weather the most boring thing in the world? Quite possibly! But not anymore -- Funny Weather delivers hilarious joke weather forecasts right to your phone.\r\n\r\nTired of all those vanilla weather apps? Want to know what the forecast is while also being insulted? Ever wonder what an offensive weather experience would be like? We at Funny Weather put in the man-hours to painstakingly craft sarcastic weather. Now through the power of modern technology, your weather app can be rude & give you mean weather updates while also keeping you informed.\r\n\r\nFeatures\r\n\u26a1Authentic weather, mean weather, and funny forecasts (profanity included!)\r\n\u26a1Accurate weather provided by Dark Sky.\r\n\u26a1Weekly & hourly fun weather forecasts.\r\n\u26a1Background changes based on the weather. \r\n\u26a1Share funny weather quotes with your friends.\r\n\u26a1Submit your own bad weather jokes.\r\n\r\nFunny Weather contains inappropriate humor, profanity, and content that some users might find offensive. Only for users 18+.",
    "descriptionHTML": "\u26a1\u2601\ufe0fWeather just got a whole lot funnier! \u2601\ufe0f\u26a1<br><br>Is the weather the most boring thing in the world? Quite possibly! But not anymore -- Funny Weather delivers hilarious joke weather forecasts right to your phone.<br><br>Tired of all those vanilla weather apps? Want to know what the forecast is while also being insulted? Ever wonder what an offensive weather experience would be like? We at Funny Weather put in the man-hours to painstakingly craft sarcastic weather. Now through the power of modern technology, your weather app can be rude &amp; give you mean weather updates while also keeping you informed.<br><br>Features<br>\u26a1Authentic weather, mean weather, and funny forecasts (profanity included!)<br>\u26a1Accurate weather provided by Dark Sky.<br>\u26a1Weekly &amp; hourly fun weather forecasts.<br>\u26a1Background changes based on the weather. <br>\u26a1Share funny weather quotes with your friends.<br>\u26a1Submit your own bad weather jokes.<br><br>Funny Weather contains inappropriate humor, profanity, and content that some users might find offensive. Only for users 18+.",
